            "review_title": "Review at The Gloria Cil",
            "review_text": "T F\nBrisbane, Australia34 contributions\n0\nSuperb food, vegetarian, perfect service, lovely location\nDec 2022\nHad a marvellous meal with a selection of dishes from the menu, that catered for the adventurous and not so adventurous. I loved the local mushroom dishes, with a nettle type green. We also had a superb mushroom tofu dish, and the braised vegetables. \nWe sat outside, and the service was perfect. It’s a great spot, sitting on a deck overlooking a wee park. Just lovely.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 24, 2022",
